WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:11.512
Spoi → Stundatöflur. A stundatafla is
a set of courses viewed together.

2
00:00:11.612 --> 00:00:17.514
Search for one by name – or type
a new name to create one.

3
00:00:17.614 --> 00:00:22.054
A new stundatafla starts empty.

4
00:00:22.154 --> 00:00:32.542
Bæta við (add) the courses that
must not clash – e.g. one year.

5
00:00:32.642 --> 00:00:37.542
Each course is saved as soon
as it is added.

6
00:00:37.642 --> 00:00:44.075
A full one, prepared earlier.

7
00:00:44.175 --> 00:00:51.077
The calendar shows Núverandi lausn –
where Spoi places each session now.

8
00:00:51.177 --> 00:00:57.268
One week, or all weeks at once;
faded boxes do not meet that week.

9
00:00:57.369 --> 00:01:04.103
Tegundir hides session types,
e.g. to see the lectures alone.

10
00:01:04.203 --> 00:01:09.863
Bókað shows what is booked
in TermTime instead.

11
00:01:09.963 --> 00:01:15.865
A number on a box: its clashes –
students, teachers, rooms.

12
00:01:15.965 --> 00:01:21.867
Kennarar (right): who teaches what,
by initials on each box.

13
00:01:21.967 --> 00:01:27.868
Below: the total clashes of this
arrangement – one line to compare.

14
00:01:27.968 --> 00:01:33.869
And every session in a table –
Athugið says what needs attention.
